h of the desk), the sofa lies to the right side of that orientation.\n\nT<abs_vis_token><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad></abs_vis_token>Therefore, the correct answer is B. right.\n</thinking>\n\n<answer>B</answer><|im_end|>","latent":{"blocks":6,"body_tokens":96,"events":[{"phase":"spatial_thinking","boundary":0,"kind":"section_entry","body_tokens":16},{"phase":"spatial_thinking","boundary":1,"kind":"source_step","body_tokens":16},{"phase":"spatial_thinking","boundary":2,"kind":"source_step","body_tokens":16},{"phase":"spatial_thinking","boundary":3,"kind":"source_step","body_tokens":16},{"phase":"thinking","boundary":0,"kind":"section_entry","body_tokens":16},{"phase":"thinking","boundary":1,"kind":"source_step","body_tokens":16}]},"prompt_sha256":"a17c892b95b6255279a4ced0fdd5878cacecd6dcf98fa5d1069c4a98c8d96fc4","rl":null}
